  "prompt": "How long do new users take to pay? Take the users who signed up in 2025 and have made at least one payment, refunded or not. signup_ts and paid_at are UTC instants, so read every month in UTC. For each user, count the calendar months from the month of the signup to the month of the first payment: 0 when both fall in the same month, 1 for the next month, and so on. Return two columns, in this order: months_to_first_payment and users, the number of such users. Return one row for each number of months that occurs. Any row order is fine.",
